{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Shared by tools/collect_literature.py (what to fetch, how to tag) and the EconRadar app (labels, colours, filters). Add a journal by appending to `journals` with its OpenAlex source id (https://api.openalex.org/sources/issn:XXXX-XXXX). A working-paper series takes kind \"working\" and, optionally, a pdfTemplate where {id} is the DOI suffix. Set `enabled` to false to stop collecting from it; papers already collected stay.",
  "lookbackDays": 60,
  "since": "2020-01-01",
  "newsletter": {"buttondown": "", "about": "Buttondown username: the Newsletter tab shows the subscribe form once it is set. Field families are the subscriber tags."},
